  scope. `routes/chat.py` derives the user from authentication; the client
  cannot override owner or organization.
- Before the fix the classifier returned false. RAG requested 15 Qdrant
  candidates, applied score threshold 0.35, and retained at most 5.
- Qdrant applies threshold plus tenant/ACL/current-version/deletion filters.
  `vector_search.py` repeats the score check, validates payload identity against
  SQLite, and hydrates authoritative text/provenance. Discarded chunks do not
  reach the response. There is no reranker in this path.
